stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SupportedAppProtocol

    SupportedAppProtocol --> SessionSetup : protocol namespace agreed

    SessionSetup --> AuthorizationSetup : new session
    SessionSetup --> AC_ChargeParameterDiscovery : resumed session, AC or AC_BPT
    SessionSetup --> AC_DER_IEC_ChargeParameterDiscovery : resumed session, AC_DER_IEC
    SessionSetup --> AC_DER_SAE_ChargeParameterDiscovery : resumed session, AC_DER_SAE
    SessionSetup --> DC_ChargeParameterDiscovery : resumed session, DC, DC_BPT, MCS or MCS_BPT

    AuthorizationSetup --> Authorization
    Authorization --> ServiceDiscovery : authorization accepted
    ServiceDiscovery --> ServiceDetail
    ServiceDetail --> ServiceSelection
    ServiceSelection --> ServiceSelection : further ServiceDetailReq

    ServiceSelection --> AC_ChargeParameterDiscovery : AC or AC_BPT selected
    ServiceSelection --> AC_DER_IEC_ChargeParameterDiscovery : AC_DER_IEC selected
    ServiceSelection --> AC_DER_SAE_ChargeParameterDiscovery : AC_DER_SAE selected
    ServiceSelection --> DC_ChargeParameterDiscovery : DC, DC_BPT, MCS or MCS_BPT selected

    AC_ChargeParameterDiscovery --> ScheduleExchange
    DC_ChargeParameterDiscovery --> ScheduleExchange

    AC_DER_IEC_ChargeParameterDiscovery --> AC_DER_IEC_ChargeParameterDiscovery : EV Processing Ongoing
    AC_DER_IEC_ChargeParameterDiscovery --> ScheduleExchange : EV Processing Finished

    AC_DER_SAE_ChargeParameterDiscovery --> AC_DER_SAE_ChargeParameterDiscovery : EV Processing Ongoing
    AC_DER_SAE_ChargeParameterDiscovery --> ScheduleExchange : EV Processing Finished
    AC_DER_SAE_ChargeParameterDiscovery --> ServiceDetail : ServiceDiscoveryReq, EV restarts service selection

    ScheduleExchange --> PowerDelivery : AC, AC_DER_IEC or AC_DER_SAE
    ScheduleExchange --> DC_CableCheck : DC, DC_BPT, MCS or MCS_BPT
    DC_CableCheck --> DC_PreCharge : cable check done
    DC_PreCharge --> PowerDelivery : EV Processing Finished

    PowerDelivery --> AC_ChargeLoop : contactor closed
    PowerDelivery --> AC_DER_IEC_ChargeLoop : contactor closed
    PowerDelivery --> AC_DER_SAE_ChargeLoop : contactor closed
    PowerDelivery --> DC_ChargeLoop
    PowerDelivery --> SessionStop : shutdown requested, AC family
    PowerDelivery --> DC_WeldingDetection : shutdown requested, DC family

    AC_ChargeLoop --> SessionStop : PowerDeliveryReq Stop or shutdown
    AC_DER_IEC_ChargeLoop --> SessionStop : PowerDeliveryReq Stop or shutdown
    AC_DER_SAE_ChargeLoop --> SessionStop : PowerDeliveryReq Stop or shutdown
    DC_ChargeLoop --> DC_WeldingDetection : PowerDeliveryReq Stop or shutdown
    DC_WeldingDetection --> SessionStop : EV Processing Finished

    SessionStop --> [*]
